# Optional: powers real email delivery for the Contact form via EmailJS.
# Create a free account at https://www.emailjs.com, add an email service and
# a template with variables: to_email, from_name, from_email, phone, message.
# Then copy this file to .env and fill in the three values below.
# Until these are set, the contact form automatically falls back to opening
# a pre-filled mailto draft to official@karmyug.co — the site works either way.

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
